<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>薩沁蔡節目冊</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@600;900&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --red: #4c7440;
    --red-dark: #32522F;
    --cream: #FBF6E9;
    --ink: #201A16;
    --gold: #F7DF87;
    --blue: #746840;
    --line: rgba(32,26,22,0.14);
    --shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(32,26,22,0.16);
  }
  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html,body{
    margin:0; padding:0;
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  body{
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--red);
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05), transparent 40%),
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0 2px, transparent 2px 6px);
    padding-bottom: 92px;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .shop-header{
    padding: 22px 20px 14px;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 2px dashed rgba(251,246,233,0.35);
  }
  .shop-eyebrow{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .shop-title{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 38px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
    .shop-subtitle{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 25px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .shop-meta{
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: rgba(251,246,233,0.85);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .shop-meta b{ color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .performer-link{
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: underline dotted;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .shop-note{
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: rgba(251,246,233,0.65);
    line-height: 1.6;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(251,246,233,0.2);
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  /* ---------- Sticky category tabs ---------- */
  .tabbar-wrap{
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 30;
    background: var(--red);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .tabbar{
    display:flex;
    gap: 8px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    scrollbar-width: none;
  }
  .tabbar::-webkit-scrollbar{ display:none; }
  .tab-btn{
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: rgba(251,246,233,0.75);
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(251,246,233,0.25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all .2s ease;
  }
  .tab-btn.active{
    background: var(--gold);
    border-color: var(--gold);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */
  .category-section{ padding: 26px 16px 6px; }
  .category-head{ margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--cream); }
  .category-name{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 28px;
  }
  .category-sub{
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(251,246,233,0.65);
    margin-top: 2px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  /* ---------- Item card (menu item / program piece) ---------- */
  .item-card{
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 13px;
    padding: 14px 14px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid rgba(32,26,22,0.06);
  }
  .item-title{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
    margin: 0 0 2px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .item-composer{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .item-note{
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(32,26,22,0.78);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    padding-top: 8px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ---------- Bottom cart / order bar ---------- */
  .order-bar{
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    bottom: 14px;
    width: calc(100% - 28px);
    max-width: 452px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    z-index: 40;
  }
  .order-info{ font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .order-info b{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--gold);
    display:block;
  }
  .order-btn{
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- Receipt drawer ---------- */
  .drawer-backdrop{
    position: fixed; inset:0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    z-index: 50;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .drawer-backdrop.open{ opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }

  .receipt-drawer{
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0;
    transform: translate(-50%, 100%);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 480px;
    max-height: 82vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
    z-index: 51;
    transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
    padding: 18px 22px 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 -10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }
  .receipt-drawer.open{ transform: translate(-50%, 0); }
  .receipt-handle{
    width: 40px; height: 4px;
    background: var(--line);
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin: 0 auto 14px;
  }
  .receipt-title{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 20px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .receipt-sub{
    text-align:center;
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(32,26,22,0.55);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .receipt-list{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .receipt-cat{
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--red);
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(32,26,22,0.15);
  }
  .receipt-cat:first-child{ padding-top: 0; }
  .receipt-total{
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 2px dashed rgba(32,26,22,0.3);
    display:flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .receipt-zigzag{
    height: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red) 25%, transparent 25%) -6px 0,
      linear-gradient(225deg, var(--red) 25%, transparent 25%) -6px 0;
    background-size: 12px 12px;
    background-repeat: repeat-x;
  }

  /* ---------- Submit order ---------- */
  .submit-order{
    display:block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 16px;
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--cream);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    padding: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .submit-order:active{ background: var(--red-dark); }

  /* ---------- Confirm / chef note view ---------- */
  .confirm-view{
    display:none;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 6px 0 4px;
  }
  .confirm-view.show{ display:block; }
  .stamp{
    display:inline-block;
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--red);
    border: 3px solid var(--red);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    transform: rotate(-8deg);
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin: 8px auto 18px;
    animation: stamp-in .35s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.3,1.4);
  }
  @keyframes stamp-in{
    0%{ opacity:0; transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(2.2); }
    70%{ opacity:1; }
    100%{ opacity:1; transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1); }
  }
  .chef-title{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .chef-note{
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: rgba(32,26,22,0.85);
    text-align: left;
    background: rgba(220,201,167,0.5);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .back-to-menu{
    display:block;
    margin: 18px auto 4px;
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(32,26,22,0.25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 9px 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .stamp{ animation: none; }
  }
  .close-drawer{
    display:block;
    margin: 16px auto 0;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-family:"Noto Sans TC", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--blue);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .receipt-drawer, .drawer-backdrop, .tab-btn{ transition: none; }
  }

  /* ---------- Performer info modal ---------- */
  .performer-modal{
    position: fixed;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.9);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    width: calc(100% - 56px);
    max-width: 380px;
    z-index: 51;
    transition: opacity .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
  }
  .performer-modal.open{
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1);
  }
  .performer-card{
    background: var(--cream);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .performer-name{
    font-family:"Noto Serif TC", serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 25px;
  }
  .performer-role{
    font-family:"JetBrains Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--blue);
    margin: 4px 0 14px;
  }
  .performer-bio{
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(32,26,22,0.8);
    text-align: left;
  }
  .performer-card .close-drawer{ margin-top: 18px; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    .performer-modal{ transition: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="shop-header">
  <div class="shop-eyebrow">帥哥美女要吃什麼</div>
  <div class="shop-title">薩沁蔡</div>
  <div class="shop-subtitle">伍宇沁＆蔡佩恩聯合音樂會</div>
  <div class="shop-meta">
    薩克斯風獨奏：<b class="performer-link" data-performer="saxophone1">蔡佩恩</b>．<b class="performer-link" data-performer="saxophone2">伍宇沁</b><br>鋼琴合作：<b class="performer-link" data-performer="piano">黃楚涵</b><br>
    2026 / 08 / 09（日）19:30．郭音樂廳
  </div>
  <div class="shop-note">
    我們有沁有蔡，但面對音樂，我們絕不「青菜」<br>
    《薩沁蔡》今夜限定營業中，希望帶給每位聽眾最高級的饗宴
  </div>
</header>

<div class="tabbar-wrap">
  <nav class="tabbar" id="tabbar"></nav>
</div>

<main id="main"></main>

<div class="order-bar">
  <div class="order-info">
    <b id="orderTotalCount">已點 0 首</b>
     你所點播的曲目，即將上菜。
  </div>
  <button class="order-btn" id="openReceipt">查看節目單</button>
</div>

<div class="drawer-backdrop" id="backdrop"></div>
<div class="receipt-drawer" id="receipt">
  <div class="receipt-handle"></div>
  <div class="receipt-title">本場節目單</div>
  <div class="receipt-sub" id="receiptMeta"></div>
  <div id="orderView">
    <div class="receipt-list" id="receiptList"></div>
    <div class="receipt-total">
      <span>TOTAL</span>
      <span id="receiptTotal">0 首</span>
    </div>
    <button class="submit-order" id="submitOrder">送出訂單 →</button>
  </div>

  <div id="confirmView" class="confirm-view">
    <div class="stamp">感謝聆聽</div>
    <div class="chef-title">— 想說的話 —</div>
    <div class="chef-note" id="chefNote"></div>
    <button class="back-to-menu" id="backToMenu">← 返回菜單瀏覽</button>
  </div>

  <div class="receipt-zigzag"></div>
  <button class="close-drawer" id="closeReceipt">收起 ▾</button>
</div>

<div class="performer-modal" id="performerModal">
  <div class="performer-card">
    <div class="performer-name" id="performerName"></div>
    <div class="performer-role" id="performerRole"></div>
    <div class="performer-bio" id="performerBio"></div>
    <button class="close-drawer" id="closePerformer">關閉 ✕</button>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
/* ============================================================
   範例曲目資料 — 之後請直接替換這個陣列裡的內容即可
   ============================================================ */
const PROGRAM = [
  {
    id: 'soup',
    name: '天國の月',
    sub: 'Performer：蔡佩恩',
    items: [
      {title:'天國之月', composer:'長生淳',
       note:'《天國之月》（La lune en paradis）由日本作曲家長生淳（Jun Nagao，1964–）於 1995 年受薩克斯風大師須川展也委託創作。<br>全曲由風格對比鮮明的兩大部分組成。第一部分充滿神秘色彩，透過不斷變化應用的音樂動機，描繪出一步步追尋那遙不可及之月的渴望與執著。第二部分則轉為疾速而激烈的風格，薩克斯風與鋼琴彼此交織對話，並融入爵士元素，在絢麗的音樂與強烈的張力中，將樂曲推向輝煌的終點。'},
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'appetizer',
    name: 'Sonate en Ut♯ pour saxophone alto et Orchestre',
    sub: 'Performer：伍宇沁',
    items: [
      {title:'升C小調奏鳴曲', composer:'Fernande Decruck',
       note:'法國作曲家 Fernande Decruck 於1943年創作的《升C小調奏鳴曲》是薩克斯風經典曲目之一，並題獻給法國薩克斯風大師 Marcel Mule。<br>全曲共四個樂章：<br>第一樂章 Modéré et très expressif（中板，極富表情）<br>以沉穩而神秘的氛圍展開，在古典奏鳴曲架構中融合法國印象派和聲與豐富色彩，展現薩克斯風寬廣而富歌唱性的旋律。<br>第二樂章 Andante（Noël） <br>引用了法國傳統聖誕頌歌《Noël Nouvelet》的旋律素材，使音樂流露出寧靜、莊嚴且帶有淡淡憂鬱的宗教氛圍。<br>第三樂章 Fileuse（紡紗女）<br>以快速流動的音型描繪紡紗輪不停旋轉的景象，技巧華麗，是全曲最具炫技性的段落。<br>第四樂章 Nocturne et Final（夜曲與終曲）<br>先以神秘沉思的夜曲展開，隨後轉入充滿力量與光彩的終曲，在英雄式的音樂中結束全曲。'},
      { note:'中場休息 15 分鐘，請於燈光暗下後盡速入座。', hidden:true, isNote:true }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'main',
    name: 'Next Angels',
    sub: 'Performer：伍宇沁',
    items: [
      {title:'下一位天使', composer:'清水大輔',
       note:'《Next Angels》是日本作曲家清水大輔於2002年改編完成的薩克斯風與鋼琴作品，原曲最初是為友人婚禮所創作的鋼琴曲。當時友人的妻子正懷著新生命，作曲家便將「第一位天使」比喻為新娘，而「下一位天使（Next Angels）」則象徵即將誕生的孩子，因此以此命名，希望演奏者能透過音樂傳達作品所蘊含的「溫柔」與「愛」，讓聽眾感受到生命延續所帶來的幸福與希望。<br>全曲約六分鐘，旋律優美流暢，以薩克斯風溫暖且富有歌唱性的音色為主軸，搭配鋼琴細膩柔和的伴奏，描繪生命從孕育、成長到迎向未來的美好景象。樂曲在抒情與明亮之間自然流轉，時而沉靜內斂，時而充滿希望與光彩，充分展現薩克斯風豐富的音色變化與情感表現力。'}
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'special',
    name: 'Maï',
    sub: 'Performer：蔡佩恩',
    items: [
      {title:'舞', composer:'野田燎',
       note:'《舞》（Mai）創作於 1975 年，作曲家野田燎（Ryo Noda, 1948–）同時也是享譽國際的日本薩克斯風演奏家。作品以日本傳統樂器「尺八」為靈感，透過薩克斯風模仿尺八特有的音色與演奏方式，呈現出與日本能劇相似的色彩與氛圍。作品沒有固定的小節線，使音樂的流動更加自由；「沉默」也是重要的音樂元素，休止不只是停頓，更像是呼吸與等待，在聲音與寂靜之間營造張力。<br>本曲並與詩作〈海戰〉相互呼應，詩作改編自《平家物語》，描寫平家武士將軍平清經（Kiyotsune Taira）在一場注定失敗的海戰前夕的心境。音樂與詩詞交織，呈現孤寂、緊張而悲壯的氛圍。'},
    { title:'海戰', composer:'《平家物語》  文：Jean Leduc，根據野田良的敘述改編',note:'在秋夜的黃昏時分，當月光將銀色光芒映照在波濤之上時，平清津將軍正吹奏著笛子。<br><br>他佇立於船首，握緊匕首，割斷束起長髮的髮辮，將其置於腳邊，隨後便消失於波濤之中。<br><br>在府邸門前，這位武士的幽靈顯現。他的妻子面對著他，問道：「你為何離去？」「為了拯救我的軍隊，」他回答道，「因為我知道這場戰役注定會輸，所以我這樣做是為了保全我的士兵及其家人的性命。」<br><br>「那我呢？」她說，「你有想過我嗎？」', hidden:true, isNote:false }
    ]
  },
  {
    id: 'side',
    name: 'Scaramouche Suite pour Saxophone et Orchestre mov.I',
    sub: 'Performer：伍宇沁',
    items: [
      {title:'Scaramouche', composer:'Darius Milhaud',
